<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br><br>Thank you for calling <span style="font-weight: bold;">National Funding</span>, we are sorry to have missed your call.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=SF%20Emails&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=MissedYouAccount">National Funding</a> has several financing programs designed to help small businesses like <span style="font-weight: bold;">{!Account.Name}</span>.&nbsp; Our products don’t require impossible credit standards and most fund within a few days.&nbsp; By this time next week you could be:<br><br><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">Up-to-date on your outstanding invoices</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">Negotiating your equipment purchase with cash in hand</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">Planning your business remodel and expansion</span><br></div><font style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif;" size="3"><br>For fastest service (1 business day), please do the following:</font><font size="3"><br></font><ul style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif;"><li><font size="3">Fill out the attached Verification Form</font></li><li><font size="3">Collect your last 6 months of Merchant Account Statements (if you accept credit cards at your business)</font></li><li><font size="3">Collect your last 6 months of Bank Statements (if you <span style="text-decoration: underline;">do not</span> accept credit cards at your business)</font></li><li><font size="3"><font size="3">Collect the first page of your most recent Business Tax Return</font></font></li><li><font size="3">Fax everything to {!User.Fax}</font></li></ul><p>Please call me to discuss your financing options.&nbsp; I'm looking forward to working with you.</p><br>Sincerely,<font size="4"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman,Times,Serif; font-style: italic;"><br><br>{!User.Name}</span></font><span style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif;"> |</span><span style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif; font-weight: bold;"> National Funding<br></span>{!User.Title}<br><a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=SF%20Emails&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=MissedYouAccount">www.nationalfunding.com</a><br>P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}<br>Email: {!User.Email}<span style="font-weight: bold;"><br><br></span><span style="font-weight: bold;"><font color="#CC0000" size="1">Follow Us on: </font><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/national.funding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNEu&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a href="http://www.linkedin.com/company/national-funding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNFn&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/NatFunding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNFx&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a></span><a title="Google+" href="https://plus.google.com/+Nationalfunding/" target="_blank" alt="Google+"><img src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001Xf1W&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5&amp;lastMod=1363900191000"></a><span style="font-size: 7.5pt;"></span>]]></td>
</tr>
